DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssxxiirrssbb driver provides support for the Reduced Serial Bus (RSB) con‐
     troller integrated on Allwinner A23/A33/A64/A80/A83T SoCs.  RSB is a two-
     wire bus developed by X-Powers as a high-speed alternative to I2C for
     connecting integrated circuits.  It is typically used for connecting de‐
     vices such as power management ICs and audio codecs.

